    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Armor (Shield), Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>You gain a +2 bonus to Armor Class against ranged attack rolls while you wield this Shield. This bonus is in addition to the Shield's normal bonus to AC.</p><p>Whenever an attacker makes a ranged attack roll against a target within 5 feet of you, you can take a Reaction to become the target of the attack instead.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-n4z3GTIVyxRRS17N\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Ranged Attack AC Bonus</strong> effect is provided for optional use and may be toggled active before a ranged attack roll is made against the wearer.</p></section><p><em>Automation (midi-qol entries):</em> +2 AC against ranged attacks while wielded (attuned); when a creature within 5 feet of you is the target of a ranged attack, you are offered your reaction to become its target (the attack roll is checked against your AC).</p>",
      "chat": ""
